13
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,120
enregistrer la nuit.

14
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:18,120
3 h 12 pile.

15
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:19,960
Un. Deux.

16
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:21,480
Trois.

17
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,040
Puis un silence.

18
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,160
Toujours trois.

19
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:25,520
JAMAIS quatre.

20
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:27,000
Onze nuits de suite.

21
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,520
Et en réécoutant,

22
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,120
